        "created_at": "2014-10-21T15:22:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Not quite:</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Sefirit\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/e68b1a/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Sefirit:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>IF ((Not(played a card<span class=\"bbcode-s\"> in your play phase</span>)AND(Not(used a power<span class=\"bbcode-s\"> in your power phase</span>))) THEN you may draw an additional card during the draw phase.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>",
